<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Julius Caesar returns four weeks after starting levetiracetam, atorvastatin, and aspirin. He has had no seizure, spell, or confused awakening. He was more irritable than usual in the first week, which has passed; he is not low in mood and has no thoughts of self-harm. His cold from last week has gone. He has no muscle aches, bruising, or bleeding. His home blood pressure readings over two weeks average 134/84 mmHg. The second rhythm monitor, removed yesterday, showed sinus rhythm throughout. The home sleep test showed no sleep apnea. He is not driving and has a riding companion at weekends. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Seizures</td><td>None since levetiracetam was started</td></tr><tr><td>Side effects</td><td>Irritability in the first week, now gone</td></tr><tr><td>Home blood pressure</td><td>Average 134/84 mmHg over two weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Monitor and sleep test</td><td>No atrial fibrillation; no sleep apnea</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

